@title Tallgrass Wind Farm Telemetry Pipeline
@subtitle Windspire Energy
@author Asset Performance
@date 2026-10-06

## Overview

Turbine data is collected on site and summarized before it is sent over a limited link. The grid operator receives output and availability figures directly from the site.

!! On satellite fallback the Control Room sees one-minute averages, not full-resolution data. The Edge Historian holds 72 hours of full-resolution data until the fiber link returns.

## Pipeline

diagram pipe dir=LR title="Tallgrass telemetry pipeline"
pipe: turb "62 Turbine Controllers" svc
pipe: scada "Site SCADA" svc
pipe: hist "Edge Historian" db "72 hours buffered"
pipe: ingest "Ingest Gateway" svc
pipe: tsdb "Time-Series Store" db
pipe: fcst "Forecast Service" svc
pipe: grid "Grid Operator" ext
pipe: ctrl "Control Room" user focus
pipe: turb -> scada : 1 sample per second
pipe: scada -> hist : buffered storage
pipe: scada -> grid : output and availability, every 4 seconds
pipe: hist -> ingest : compressed batches over satellite or fiber
pipe: ingest -> tsdb : validated samples
pipe: tsdb -> fcst : history
pipe: fcst -> ctrl : 24 hour output forecast
pipe: tsdb -> ctrl : live and historical views
pipe: group site "Tallgrass Site" turb, scada, hist
pipe: group cloud "Windspire Operations Cloud" ingest, tsdb, fcst
pipe: legend

## Sizing

kpi Turbines | 62
kpi Signals per turbine | 140
kpi Samples per second | 8680
kpi Samples per day | about 750 million

table = Item,Value; Full-resolution retention,30 days; One-minute average retention,5 years; Fiber link,100 Mbps; Satellite fallback,2 Mbps (one-minute averages only); Edge Historian buffer,72 hours of full-resolution data
